# The game's address on the internet: the one place the production domain is
# set. nginx asks Let's Encrypt for its certificates by this name and by
# www.<this name>, which it sends on here (nginx/nginx.conf.template); the
# deploy workflow checks /api/health here after every deploy, and the offsite
# backup sync connects to it. Its DNS records: .claude/commands/redeploy.md.
# scripts/deploy.sh refuses to run while it is empty.
MATHGAME_DOMAIN=animath.xyz
